smart.link_missing = Tshiko a tshi wanali — Ṱumanya Smart Object Hafhu u tshi vhuyedzedza
smart.link_browser = Tshiko tsho ṱumanywaho tsho vhulungwa lwa tshifhinganyana — hu ṱoḓea app ya desikithopo u tshi khwinisa
